#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Paralelni upiti"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "Pozadinski sistem za paralelne upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Odaberite način izvršavanja paralelnih FlowView upita. Naslijeđeni PHP pokretač pokreće proces flowview_runner.php za svaki upit i shard. FlowView servis za upite prosljeđuje isti map-reduce posao dugotrajnom Go servisu preko localhosta, čime se izbjegava pokretanje procesa za svaki upit i kašnjenje pri ispitivanju baze podataka. Zahtijeva da servis flowview-query (pogledajte plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) bude instaliran i pokrenut."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Naslijeđeni PHP pokretač"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "FlowView servis za upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL servisa za upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "Osnovni URL za FlowView servis za upite, na primjer http://127.0.0.1:8699. Ostavite prazno za automatsko otkrivanje privremenog porta iz datoteke porta servisa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Datoteka porta servisa za upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Putanja do datoteke porta u koju FlowView servis za upite upisuje svoju vezanu adresu. Koristi se za otkrivanje krajnje tačke servisa kada je URL servisa za upite iznad prazan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Token servisa za upite"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Opcionalna dijeljena tajna. Kada je postavljena, Cacti je šalje FlowView servisu za upite kao zaglavlje \"Authorization: Bearer\", a servis odbija svaki zahtjev koji mijenja stanje ako ne sadrži isti token. Postavite odgovarajuću vrijednost u konfiguracijskoj datoteci servisa (auth_token) ili u varijabli okruženja FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN. Preporučuje se kad god je servis dostupan bilo čemu osim pouzdanih lokalnih procesa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj istovremenih niti"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj niti koje će biti poslane za izvršavanje FlowView upita. Imajte na umu da možete imati najviše 1 nit po particiji baze podataka i trebate paziti da ne preopteretite server baze podataka pokretanjem prevelikog broja istovremenih niti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Onemogućeno"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Threads"
msgstr "%d niti"

